# Enhanced Ordering Flow Implementation Plan

This plan outlines adding complexity to the ordering flow to ensure data integrity and better order management.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - [createOrderFromCart](file:///home/mvrck/workspace/digital-kitchen/src/services/order.services.js#5-33) will now validate that each item is currently available in the [Food](file:///home/mvrck/workspace/digital-kitchen/src/services/food.services.js#8-15) model.
> - [createOrderFromCart](file:///home/mvrck/workspace/digital-kitchen/src/services/order.services.js#5-33) will recalculate the total price based on the current database prices to prevent stale pricing.
> - A new service and controller will be added to update the status of an order.

## Proposed Changes

### [Services]

#### [MODIFY] [order.services.js](file:///home/mvrck/workspace/digital-kitchen/src/services/order.services.js)
- Update [createOrderFromCart](file:///home/mvrck/workspace/digital-kitchen/src/services/order.services.js#5-33):
    - Check `isAvailable` for each food item.
    - Throw error if any item is unavailable.
    - Explicitly calculate `totalAmount`.
- Add `updateOrderStatus(userId, orderId, status)`:
    - Update the status of an existing order.
    - Only allow valid status transitions (optional, but good for "Preparing" -> "Out for Delivery", etc.).

---

### [Validators]

#### [MODIFY] [order.validators.js](file:///home/mvrck/workspace/digital-kitchen/src/validators/order.validators.js)
- Add `updateOrderStatusSchema`:
    - Validate that the status is one of the allowed enum values.

---

### [Controllers]

#### [MODIFY] [order.controller.js](file:///home/mvrck/workspace/digital-kitchen/src/controllers/order.controller.js)
- Add `updateOrderStatusController`:
    - Thin wrapper for `updateOrderStatus` service.

---

### [Routes]

#### [MODIFY] [order.routes.js](file:///home/mvrck/workspace/digital-kitchen/src/routes/order.routes.js)
- Add `PATCH /api/orders/:id/status` endpoint.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Attempt to place an order with an unavailable item (manually toggle `isAvailable` in DB).
- Verify that the total price is correctly calculated.
- Verify that order status can be updated.
